' ============================================================
' Title:     Selma — Use Case Identities (canonical labels)
' Purpose:   Bind use-case groups and ROD ovals to the SAME
'            package titles and C4 peers as package / class / C4.
'            Group rectangles MUST use $TITLE_APP_* / $TITLE_IF_*
'            / $TITLE_DOM_* from package pkg_identities (SSoT).
' Contract:  1.3.0
'
' Include AFTER uc_styles.puml.
'
' Identity binding (must stay identical):
'   Use-case group rectangle  == package nested package title
'                             == class package box title
'                             == C4 component id (dual for compile)
'   Use-case oval name        == package application leaf
'                             == class <<Use Case>> type name
' ============================================================

